# "Testing: Board — Trigger storm" (room/testing-rooms.ts): the operator, 2026-10-23, "a very complex
# board with tons of creatures and potential triggers". Fifteen creatures a side, and nearly every one
# on the human's side a trigger: a creature entering (Soul Warden, Impact Tremors, Mentor of the Meek),
# dying (Blood Artist, Zulaport Cutthroat, and the AI's Doomed Traveler) or a spell cast (Young
# Pyromancer). Pyroclasm in hand clears every X/2 on both sides at once — the most triggers one card
# makes — and Goblin Bombardment sacrifices one creature at a time; Siege-Gang Commander enters with
# three more. Everything starts untapped and ready to attack, at seat 0's own Main Phase 1, with the
# lands to cast the hand. Life is 40 a side, so a storm of drains does not end the game in one turn.
